WEBVTT

00:33:58.746 --> 00:34:02.038
You can admire the the skills
and the genius of

00:34:02.038 --> 00:34:03.996
the performer who executed it, right? Yes
.

00:34:04.038 --> 00:34:06.746
OK, next favorite character
from the office.

00:34:07.246 --> 00:34:08.746
It has to be Michael Scott,

00:34:08.746 --> 00:34:13.204
not because just because I think
he is the hub of the wheel.

00:34:13.204 --> 00:34:18.121
And so everyone is kind of it feels like
they're all kind of in his orbit,

00:34:18.121 --> 00:34:18.954
to mix metaphors.

00:34:18.954 --> 00:34:22.621
So interesting. He wasn't even
in my top five. I love that.

00:34:23.663 --> 00:34:26.121
And then can I ask you the same
question about Star Wars?

00:34:26.329 --> 00:34:32.038
I think my favorite my favorite character
in in Star Wars was Han.